WEBVTT

00:03.253 --> 00:06.046
<i>Causes of death are many and varied.</i>

00:06.047 --> 00:09.217
<i>Old age, suicide, illness...</i>

00:09.718 --> 00:14.180
<i>But the cause of death that scares
the most people in this day and age...</i>

00:18.143 --> 00:19.310
<i>...is death by fire.</i>

00:24.441 --> 00:26.901
The Great Cataclysm has begun...

00:27.861 --> 00:29.571
<i>Breaking news!</i>

00:36.536 --> 00:38.830
Fire!

00:39.497 --> 00:40.331
Don't!

00:44.377 --> 00:46.086
Defeat that Titan.

00:46.087 --> 00:47.546
All right, fine.

00:47.547 --> 00:49.007
Dunk!

01:08.651 --> 01:09.861
What was that?

01:16.367 --> 01:17.410
It couldn't be...

01:18.036 --> 01:19.496
But they aren't particularly good.

01:25.084 --> 01:26.251
Trash.

01:26.252 --> 01:27.753
Where are you aiming?

01:27.754 --> 01:28.880
No...

01:34.010 --> 01:35.595
Precisely as I ordered.

01:38.264 --> 01:39.849
The Third Pillar...

03:15.945 --> 03:17.405
The Third Pillar...

03:52.398 --> 03:54.776
You can fall all the
way to the outer space.

04:04.702 --> 04:06.579
I do not need the Evangelist's Grace.

04:33.398 --> 04:36.108
You are in high spirits, Lady Inca.

04:36.109 --> 04:38.945
Did you see something after the mass?

04:40.571 --> 04:41.655
Well, yeah.

04:41.656 --> 04:43.949
The future that's going to happen to me.

04:43.950 --> 04:48.578
My! A future where you get
slaughtered like a pig?

04:48.579 --> 04:50.039
Looks like that's not happening yet.

04:50.623 --> 04:54.752
But something interesting's going
to happen. I won't be bored today!

04:55.712 --> 05:00.008
I am overjoyed that you are
so excited, Lady Inca.

05:04.178 --> 05:07.640
So that's the other "Mightiest"?

05:08.349 --> 05:10.560
Insane...

05:15.982 --> 05:17.150
Shinra?!

05:17.942 --> 05:19.110
Captain Pan!

05:19.694 --> 05:20.819
Shinra's in the air!

05:20.820 --> 05:23.363
What?! Why's he here?!

05:23.364 --> 05:26.158
The 8th really was the enemy!

05:26.159 --> 05:28.452
The Titan had to be their doing too!

05:28.453 --> 05:32.205
Karin, they're not! You've got
the wrong idea of Shinra!

05:32.206 --> 05:34.709
He came here to stop it like us!

05:35.209 --> 05:38.504
Captain, send me to rescue Shinra!

05:39.005 --> 05:41.256
- All right. Do it!
- Captain!

05:41.257 --> 05:43.968
He's a Devil who killed his own mother!

05:49.265 --> 05:53.144
Yes, sir. The 4th never
leaves anyone behind!

05:56.898 --> 05:58.024
Shinra!

06:01.569 --> 06:02.445
A White-Clad?!

06:06.616 --> 06:07.992
I felt no resistance.

06:10.203 --> 06:12.747
He made a part of his body transparent?

06:14.207 --> 06:19.212
You are not only able to fly, but also
deceive others of your appearance?

06:20.004 --> 06:22.340
You show an interest in me?

06:23.091 --> 06:26.010
It must be inconvenient to have
to move one arrow at a time.

06:27.929 --> 06:29.222
Your power...

06:30.139 --> 06:31.556
What is its mechanism?

06:31.557 --> 06:36.437
All objects possess gravity
which draws one to another.

06:36.938 --> 06:39.148
That is the law of universal gravitation.

06:39.941 --> 06:43.778
<i>An object's gravity
is proportional to its mass.</i>

06:44.320 --> 06:49.158
<i>Thus, small objects
are drawn to large objects.</i>

06:49.909 --> 06:54.830
The reason objects around Earth
are drawn to the Earth

06:54.831 --> 06:59.168
is that the Earth's gravity is greater
than anything else around it.

06:59.669 --> 07:05.508
My power uses an Adolla Burst to
manipulate this law and control gravity.

07:06.300 --> 07:09.344
By imbuing the particles
which compose matter

07:09.345 --> 07:12.431
and using an Adolla Burst
to increase their mass,

07:12.432 --> 07:14.851
I can increase gravity as I will.

07:18.771 --> 07:22.774
Using this power,
I can bend the path of light,

07:22.775 --> 07:28.156
change the direction of gravity
and drop things into the sky.

07:32.743 --> 07:35.538
Perhaps you understand me a little now?

07:43.004 --> 07:45.422
So you can also use an Adolla Burst?

07:45.423 --> 07:49.051
The Pillars are not the only ones
who can use Adolla Bursts.

07:50.720 --> 07:57.143
I was worthy of being your
Guardian, but you refused me.

07:58.186 --> 08:00.688
You could have had me to guard you.

08:01.397 --> 08:05.859
You abandoned your duty as a Pillar,
betrayed the Evangelist,

08:05.860 --> 08:08.488
and became a pitiful lost child.

08:09.697 --> 08:14.285
Your Guardian simply hides
in cowardice and looses arrows.

08:15.369 --> 08:19.373
If you had me to guard you,
I would not allow this to happen to you.

08:22.293 --> 08:23.293
Show yourself, Faerie?!

08:23.294 --> 08:25.046
Stay there and watch.

08:26.672 --> 08:30.510
The prelude
to the Great Cataclysm to come.

08:32.970 --> 08:34.054
He disappeared?!

08:34.055 --> 08:35.389
Shinra!

08:44.357 --> 08:47.151
That small child is
part of the White-Clad?

08:52.281 --> 08:53.282
Brother...

08:57.537 --> 08:58.745
Hey!

08:58.746 --> 09:00.498
Hey, you!

09:01.832 --> 09:03.292
How's Shinra?!

09:08.673 --> 09:10.174
He disappeared again...

09:29.819 --> 09:33.030
You're finally weak enough
that I can enjoy this.

09:53.926 --> 09:56.262
The Titan just... fell apart.

10:45.853 --> 10:48.272
Huh? Iris?

10:51.108 --> 10:53.944
I can feel Adolla approaching closer.

10:54.445 --> 10:57.156
We have finally come this close.

10:57.740 --> 11:00.951
I have been waiting for this
ever since that day.

11:09.835 --> 11:12.879
<i>That day, 250 years ago.</i>

11:12.880 --> 11:15.966
<i>The first Great Cataclysm ended
in failure.</i>

11:17.843 --> 11:22.347
<i>However, the link with
Adolla grew stronger,</i>

11:22.348 --> 11:26.310
<i>so I could come to this side
with the insects.</i>

11:34.819 --> 11:41.033
<i>In human terms,
I am what they would call a Devil.</i>

11:41.617 --> 11:46.247
<i>I searched for someone who had influence.</i>

11:47.039 --> 11:50.668
<i>To that person... to that human...</i>

11:59.051 --> 12:02.263
<i>I had to provide them with this girl:</i>

12:04.140 --> 12:07.435
<i>Amaterasu, who possesses and Adolla Burst.</i>

12:10.271 --> 12:16.068
<i>I found a caravan of survivors
from the Great Cataclysm.</i>

12:16.819 --> 12:18.611
<i>The caravan's leader,</i>

12:18.612 --> 12:21.407
<i>Raffles Smith.</i>

12:21.949 --> 12:23.325
<i>That was the man's name.</i>

12:30.166 --> 12:34.587
<i>The survivors of humanity would
redo everything from square one.</i>

12:35.629 --> 12:38.465
<i>This man would be their guide,</i>

12:38.466 --> 12:40.801
<i>and the founder of the faith.</i>

12:44.305 --> 12:49.100
<i>Humans are strange organisms
that like fictitious stories.</i>

12:49.101 --> 12:54.647
<i>Novels, films, comics,
myths, and religions.</i>

12:54.648 --> 12:57.026
<i>They will believe anything.</i>

12:57.735 --> 13:00.779
<i>Including the religion that will soon be.</i>

13:01.989 --> 13:07.328
<i>Raffles will be the founder,
by bringing back Amaterasu.</i>

13:07.912 --> 13:11.623
<i>He was a man who launched the caravan,</i>

13:11.624 --> 13:14.792
<i>thinking only of restoring humanity.</i>

13:14.793 --> 13:17.087
<i>And he will found the faith.</i>

13:20.799 --> 13:26.930
<i>All founders of all faiths are always
simple humans who spew nonsense.</i>

13:26.931 --> 13:30.476
<i>They are no different
from the ignorant, useless masses.</i>

13:30.976 --> 13:36.439
<i>If there was anything different
about him, it was that he had felt Adolla.</i>

13:36.440 --> 13:39.568
<i>That was the only difference.</i>

13:41.362 --> 13:45.406
<i>He would recreate civilization
with Amaterasu's Adolla Burst</i>

13:45.407 --> 13:47.743
<i>and produce Pillars to link
this world with Adolla.</i>

13:48.244 --> 13:50.287
<i>This is where it began.</i>

13:51.121 --> 13:55.376
<i>This new religion
with Amaterasu as its center.</i>

13:56.001 --> 13:58.587
<i>Perhaps I should call
it the Holy Sol Temple.</i>

14:02.049 --> 14:05.218
<i>The people grew fanatical
about the Holy Sol Temple.</i>

14:05.219 --> 14:08.012
<i>The same way they had
repeated throughout history.</i>

14:08.013 --> 14:12.977
<i>People do love
fictitious stories, after all.</i>

14:45.634 --> 14:47.261
Flame of Adolla,

14:48.304 --> 14:50.639
light this world aflame.

15:00.566 --> 15:01.859
This is...

15:03.402 --> 15:04.820
an Adolla Link?

15:06.071 --> 15:07.488
With you?!

15:07.489 --> 15:08.532
Yo.

15:10.826 --> 15:12.244
Long time no see.

15:12.786 --> 15:14.872
Why you and me?

15:15.372 --> 15:17.081
Why an Adolla Link?

15:17.082 --> 15:21.670
I don't know what's going on over there,
but I heard you're unconscious.

15:23.380 --> 15:25.633
I stopped Juggernaut's cannon...

15:26.634 --> 15:31.764
And the pillar of the Great Cataclysm
was born, so our link grew stronger.

15:32.348 --> 15:34.474
The Great Cataclysm's begun...

15:34.475 --> 15:36.352
It's only just the start.

15:37.102 --> 15:40.313
What the heck is the Great Cataclysm?!
Do you know anything about it?!

15:40.314 --> 15:43.441
I don't know.
It's my first time seeing one.

15:43.442 --> 15:48.112
You can see the future, right? Then don't
you know what's going to happen?

15:48.113 --> 15:54.118
Hey, now. You and the 8th came out
to stop the Great Cataclysm, right?

15:54.119 --> 15:55.746
You assume it's going to happen.

15:56.830 --> 16:00.542
I can only see the future when
it's guaranteed to happen.

16:01.502 --> 16:04.004
I can't see what's going to happen yet.

16:04.630 --> 16:08.258
You can fly so fast that you
can see the past, right?

16:12.304 --> 16:16.724
If you go to the past and see the world
before the Great Cataclysm,

16:16.725 --> 16:18.936
you might find out what's going
to happen from here on.

16:20.229 --> 16:23.482
But can I... do that?

16:25.401 --> 16:31.281
I can't see the past, but I can predict
what's going to happen in the future.

16:32.574 --> 16:35.285
You're going to go see the past.

16:35.786 --> 16:37.162
Huh?

16:39.748 --> 16:41.709
- And you're taking me with you.
- Hey!

16:42.292 --> 16:46.005
There's no point refusing.
That's what's going to happen.

16:48.549 --> 16:50.634
You fly so fast that
we go back to the past.

16:53.470 --> 16:54.762
And then...

16:54.763 --> 16:56.432
you'll fall in love with me.

16:57.016 --> 17:00.768
I can see it. You make love with me.

17:00.769 --> 17:01.687
Don't lie!

17:02.354 --> 17:05.523
Even you can't see the flame of love!

17:05.524 --> 17:07.276
Quit spewing nonsense.

17:08.152 --> 17:08.986
Let's go.

17:09.903 --> 17:11.530
Don't fall off.

17:27.463 --> 17:30.549
<i>Fly faster than the speed
of light, into the past.</i>

17:40.434 --> 17:41.893
Where are we?

17:41.894 --> 17:43.269
This world is where

17:43.270 --> 17:45.481
you go when you go faster
than light and break down into particles.

17:51.528 --> 17:53.237
Oh, is that...

17:53.238 --> 17:54.990
Before the Great Cataclysm...

18:02.289 --> 18:03.998
<i>I've tried imagining it before.</i>

18:03.999 --> 18:05.292
<i>The past.</i>

18:05.918 --> 18:07.878
<i>Tokyo before the Great Cataclysm.</i>

18:10.005 --> 18:15.219
<i>People just like us,
living lives just like ours.</i>

18:16.303 --> 18:20.265
<i>The only difference is that
there's no human combustion.</i>

18:21.809 --> 18:23.435
<i>That's the only difference.</i>

19:19.825 --> 19:23.704
<i>Those... creatures that look like humans.</i>

19:30.169 --> 19:33.130
<i>I couldn't take my eyes
off the world of the past.</i>

19:34.089 --> 19:38.218
<i>I felt an overwhelming sense
of insecurity that chipped away</i>

19:39.011 --> 19:41.471
<i>all of my blind faith that I was sane.</i>

19:44.975 --> 19:47.311
<i>A strong feeling of nausea and vertigo.</i>

19:53.567 --> 19:55.485
<i>I held back insanity.</i>

20:05.829 --> 20:08.581
<i>Today, before dawn, a car
was found burning in a parking lot</i>

20:08.582 --> 20:11.376
<i>near Komagome Station
in the Toyoshima Ward.</i>

20:12.336 --> 20:16.005
<i>The fire was put out within
an hour of being reported.</i>

20:16.006 --> 20:19.468
<i>No signs of human combustion
were found at the scene,</i>

20:20.052 --> 20:25.599
<i>so the military police are investigating
the cause as either arson or an accident.</i>

20:27.267 --> 20:28.602
<i>Our next story.</i>

20:29.603 --> 20:32.272
<i>Three months have passed
since the first pillar appeared.</i>

20:32.981 --> 20:35.943
<i>A new, fifth pillar has appeared.</i>

20:37.486 --> 20:38.528
Fifth pillar?!

20:39.029 --> 20:42.950
TO BE CONTINUED

22:14.499 --> 22:15.792
NEXT TIME

22:16.293 --> 22:18.294
<i>Shinra, where have you been all this time?</i>

22:18.295 --> 22:21.589
<i>You did something that you
absolutely must never do.</i>

22:21.590 --> 22:23.049
<i>I...</i>

22:23.050 --> 22:24.884
<i>Next time, "Self-Unaware."</i>

22:24.885 --> 22:27.512
<i>Return to the great flame of fire.</i> Látom.
